{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choco Kiosk Simulator</strong> is a cozy first-person sweet shop simulator. Run your kiosk, serve customers, upgrade your storage, complete tasks, research new flavors, and grow your business \u2014 from a simple stand to a chocolate empire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf6b What you'll be doing:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udeaa <strong>Open and close your kiosk</strong> \u2013 control shutters and lights manually</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Store boxes</strong> \u2013 manage a carousel warehouse with upgradable slots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f <strong>Stock the shelves</strong> \u2013 keep the right products in the right spots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u23f1\ufe0f <strong>Serve customers</strong> \u2013 don't let them wait too long</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\uddd1\ufe0f <strong>Clean up trash</strong> \u2013 affects your reputation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2b50 <strong>Earn reputation</strong> \u2013 attract more customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddea <strong>Research new flavors</strong> \u2013 invest money to unlock new products</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddfe <strong>Complete tasks</strong> \u2013 daily and weekly goals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfea <strong>Handle B2B orders</strong> \u2013 fulfill bulk internet shop requests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude9a <strong>Wait for deliveries</strong> \u2013 plan around delays</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Upgrade your kiosk</strong> \u2013 expand storage and shelves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfab <strong>Buy scratch tickets</strong> \u2013 get random bonuses after good shifts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udef8 <strong>Run an illegal kiosk</strong> \u2013 sell weird goods at high prices (with risk)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf19 <strong>Survive the night</strong> \u2013 stay inside or sleep until morning</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uddc1 Why play:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This isn\u2019t about spreadsheets or business models. It\u2019s about detail, chaos, and the small joys of running your own messy little shop. Stock the shelves. Clean up. Serve with care. Let your kiosk live \u2014 slowly, calmly, but for real.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3814130?t=1750511164","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3814130?t=1750511164","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814130/0c04ff460850c5223105eb04d653c95b08044b62/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750511164","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814130/0c04ff460850c5223105eb04d653c95b08044b62/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750511164","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choco Kiosk Simulator</strong> is a cozy first-person sweet shop simulator. Run your kiosk, serve customers, upgrade your storage, complete tasks, research new flavors, and grow your business \u2014 from a simple stand to a chocolate empire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf6b What you'll be doing:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udeaa <strong>Open and close your kiosk</strong> \u2013 control shutters and lights manually</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Store boxes</strong> \u2013 